1
00:00:00,245 --> 00:00:02,294
One sneeze—and Chewinstein broke physics.

2
00:00:02,575 --> 00:00:04,314
Oops! What if E doesn't equal mc squared?

3
00:00:04,675 --> 00:00:07,002
First—light speed collapses like tired Wi-Fi!

4
00:00:07,325 --> 00:00:09,490
My lamp's photons are literally walking past me!

5
00:00:09,975 --> 00:00:12,269
Nice math, genius—now atoms can't pay energy bills!

6
00:00:12,775 --> 00:00:14,749
Mass loses its power, and gravity goes wild!

7
00:00:15,125 --> 00:00:17,522
Stars need fusion math to shine—no equation, no Sun!

8
00:00:17,825 --> 00:00:19,940
Brrr! Even my Einstein hair is freezing!

9
00:00:20,325 --> 00:00:22,451
Until Chewinstein grabs gold chalk—and slams back equals!

10
00:00:22,975 --> 00:00:25,137
Boom! Mass equals pure glowing energy again!

11
00:00:25,575 --> 00:00:27,448
So physics stays safe—mostly anyway.

12
00:00:27,775 --> 00:00:29,608
Actually... E equals mc squared, plus coffee!
